@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Optimistic update through the TodoApi port
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "User" as user
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (UI components)" #E0F2FE
  participant "TodoItemComponent" as item
  participant "TodoListComponent" as list
  participant "TodoPageComponent" as page
end box
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (state and API client)" #E0F2FE
  participant "TodoStore" as store
  participant "HttpTodoApi" as http
end box
box "Backend — Laravel API (HTTP layer)" #D1FADF
  participant "Laravel API" as api
end box
user -> item : Check the task checkbox
item -> list : Emit toggle through output() (L2-046)
list -> page : Re-emit toggle through output() (L2-046)
page -> store : Request completion change for the task
store -> store : Write todos signal optimistically (L2-047)
store -> store : Recompute activeCount, completedCount, progress (L2-047)
store --> page : Signals notify OnPush components (L2-039)
page --> user : Updated row and counts within 100 ms (L2-039)
store -> http : Call TodoApi, resolved to HttpTodoApi (L2-048)
http -> api : PATCH /api/v1/todos/{id} through HttpClient and firstValueFrom (L2-048)
alt Server accepts the change
  api --> http : 200 with todo resource
  http --> store : Typed todo from core/api/models (L2-048)
  store -> store : Reconcile todos signal with the server version
else Request fails
  api --> http : Network error or error response
  http --> store : Rejected promise
  store -> store : Revert todos signal and set toast signal (L2-047)
  store --> page : Signals notify OnPush components (L2-039)
  page --> user : Reverted row and error toast
end
@enduml
